          "text": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The Jubilee Parkway is a pair of parallel concrete viaduct\nbridges that carry Interstate 10 across Mobile Bay from the George Wallace\nTunnel on Blakeley Island in Mobile, Alabama, eastbound to Spanish Fort/Daphne,\nAlabama.<o:p></o:p></p>"
