          "title": "Battleship Parkway (Causeway)",
          "text": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Battleship Parkway is a 7-mile long causeway that carries US\n90 and US 98 eastbound across Mobile Bay from the Bankhead Tunnel on Blakeley\nIsland in Mobile, Alabama to Spanish Fort, Alabama. The roadway itself is a\nfour-lane divided highway for most of its length. It is very susceptible to\nflooding and is usually submerged during hurricane storm surges.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The Battleship\nParkway is home to Battleship Memorial Park and to many of the Mobile area's\nmore prominent seafood restaurants.<o:p></o:p></p>"
